<title>SPAIN: Metrovacesa sees 1997 pretax up 15 pct.</title>
<headline>Metrovacesa sees 1997 pretax up 15 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish property company Metrovacesa said on Friday it expects to end 1997 with pretax profit up 15 percent.</p>
<p>Metrovacesa ended its first quarter 1997 with a 22 percent increase in pretax profit, it said in a statement.</p>
